# ─── Android (Capacitor) build template ───
# Copy to .env.android and fill in real values. .env.android is git-ignored —
# never commit it. NEVER put backend secrets (DATABASE_URL, JWT_SECRET,
# RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET) in the frontend/Android app — only client-safe variables.

# REQUIRED — the SAME production backend the Web POS uses (no localhost).
# Build the Android bundle with:  npm run build -- --mode android
VITE_API_URL=https://pos-app-backend-production.up.railway.app/api
